      "content": "I get the caution, but we're moving fast on this one. I don't want to be the one telling the committee we're passing because of a minor monthly variance when the fundamentals look this strong. If I were to frame this to the partners, could we reasonably argue that the growth hasn't actually slowed, but rather shifted into a more sustainable, higher-quality acquisition phase that the current metrics are just catching up to? Basically, can we still call this a high-growth trajectory?",
